# =========================================================================
# .gitignore for the mwperm R package
# Goal: the public repository contains ONLY the installable R package
# (R/, man/, data/, data-raw/, vignettes/, DESCRIPTION, NAMESPACE,
# README.md, NEWS.md). Everything listed below stays on the local machine
# and is never pushed.
#
# Note: ignore rules do not untrack files that are already committed, so the
# private development branch (review-and-unify) keeps its tracked copies of
# tests/, demo/, sim-cache/ etc.; on the public branch the same paths are
# simply invisible to git. Adding NEW files under these paths on the private
# branch requires `git add -f`.
# =========================================================================

# ----- R build artifacts -----
*.tar.gz
*.Rcheck/
..Rcheck/
/*.Rout
src/*.o
src/*.so
src/*.dll
inst/doc/

# generated replication artifacts (the scripts + expected/ are tracked)
inst/replication/out/
inst/replication/cache/

# ----- R / RStudio machine-local state -----
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

# ----- vignette / knitr build outputs -----
vignettes/*.html
vignettes/*.R
vignettes/*_cache/
vignettes/*_files/

# ----- OS / editor cruft -----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# =========================================================================
# PRIVATE / LOCAL-ONLY MATERIAL -- never for the public repository
# =========================================================================

# Third-party material that is NOT ours to redistribute:
# the paper authors' replication code and the reference-paper PDFs
# (plus the local convenience symlink to the authors' code).
shared code/
shared code
more_info/
reference/
report/
Reference papers/

# Local project memory / internal design docs
IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md

# Internal review/task artifacts (development record, private branch only)
PROGRESS.md
REVIEW.md
docs/

# Development-only test suite, demo script, and validation simulations
# (kept on the private branch; not shipped in the public package repo)
demo/
sim-cache/
CLAUDE.md
audit/
Extra info/
AUDIT_BRIEF.md
